# Ender-3 V3 SE mainboard, chip STM32F401 (some C14 boards).
# Same settings as SimpleAF's Nebula Pad C14 firmware (pellcorp/kalico aug2026
# .config.e3v3se-c14; confirmed on a C14 with a Nebula Pad, pellcorp/creality#1702).
# 64 KiB bootloader, 8 MHz crystal, serial to the Nebula Pad on USART2, 230400.
# expect: CONFIG_FLASH_APPLICATION_ADDRESS=0x8010000 CONFIG_MCU="stm32f401xc" CONFIG_SERIAL_BAUD=230400
CONFIG_LOW_LEVEL_OPTIONS=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32F401=y
CONFIG_STM32_FLASH_START_10000=y
CONFIG_STM32_CLOCK_REF_8M=y
CONFIG_STM32_SERIAL_USART2=y
CONFIG_SERIAL_BAUD=230400
